  "source_text": "Reception, good afternoon. How can I help you? Hi. I'm staying in a standard room until Sunday. My name's Lina. Yes, I have your reservation here. What can I do for you? My flight has been changed to Monday morning, so I'd like to stay one more night, on Sunday. Is that possible? I'm sorry, your room is booked on Sunday night. But our sister hotel is a ten-minute walk away, and it has a room for seventy-five dollars. Thanks, but I'd rather not move to another hotel with all my bags. Is there anything here instead? We have a superior room for Sunday night. It's a hundred dollars, so twenty more than your room. That's okay. Would I need to move my things myself? No, housekeeping can move your bags on Sunday morning while you're out. Perfect. So, the superior room on Sunday night for a hundred dollars, and you'll move my bags. That's right. I've added Sunday to your reservation. Have a nice day!",
  "source_turns": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Reception, good afternoon. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi. I'm staying in a standard room until Sunday. My name's Lina."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes, I have your reservation here. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "My flight has been changed to Monday morning, so I'd like to stay one more night, on Sunday. Is that possible?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "I'm sorry, your room is booked on Sunday night. But our sister hotel is a ten-minute walk away, and it has a room for seventy-five dollars."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Thanks, but I'd rather not move to another hotel with all my bags. Is there anything here instead?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "We have a superior room for Sunday night. It's a hundred dollars, so twenty more than your room."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "That's okay. Would I need to move my things myself?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "No, housekeeping can move your bags on Sunday morning while you're out."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Perfect. So, the superior room on Sunday night for a hundred dollars, and you'll move my bags."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That's right. I've added Sunday to your reservation. Have a nice day!"
    }
  ],
